  <title>Back Matter</title>

  <appendix xml:id="original-front-matter">
    <title>From the Original Book</title>
    <p>These sections come from <pubtitle>Foundations of Python Programming</pubtitle>.
    The license names them as Invariant Sections, so they appear here word for word.
    They talk about Python because the original book used Python.</p>
