  <appendix xml:id="history">
    <title>History</title>
    <p><ul>
      <li><p><alert>2026.</alert> <pubtitle>Foundations of Programming with JavaScript</pubtitle>.
      Adapted by Jacob Darouse, with help from Claude (Anthropic). Published by Jacob Darouse.
      Moved the book from Python to JavaScript and reordered it to follow the
      Fundamentals of Software Development course.</p></li>
      <li><p><pubtitle>Foundations of Python Programming</pubtitle>.
      By Brad Miller, Paul Resnick, Lauren Murphy, Jeffrey Elkner, Peter Wentworth, Allen B. Downey, Chris Meyers, and Dario Mitchell.
      Published on Runestone Academy.
      Built on <pubtitle>How to Think Like a Computer Scientist: Interactive Edition</pubtitle> by Brad Miller and David Ranum,
      and the original <pubtitle>How to Think Like a Computer Scientist</pubtitle> by Jeffrey Elkner, Allen B. Downey, and Chris Meyers.</p></li>
    </ul></p>
  </appendix>

  <xi:include href="./back/gfdl.ptx" />
</backmatter>
